This policy setting allows admins to enable "Save Target As" context menu in Internet Explorer mode. If you enable this policy, "Save Target As" will show up in the Internet Explorer mode context menu and work the same as Internet Explorer. If you disable or do not configure this policy setting, "Save Target As" will not show up in the Internet Explorer mode context menu. For more information, see https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2102115

