desc:
Enable this policy to specify the maximum number of hours from the start time that users can set their active hours. The max active hours range can be set between 8 and 18 hours. If you disable or do not configure this policy, the default max active hours range will be used.

**Supported on:** Windows_10_0_NOARM - At least Windows Server 2016 or Windows 10

```c
"HKLM\\Software\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows\\WindowsUpdate";
    "SetActiveHoursMaxRange"; // Type: REG_DWORD
                              // Enabled = 1
                              // Disabled = 0
"HKLM\\Software\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows\\WindowsUpdate";
    "ActiveHoursMaxRange"; // 8 = 8
                           // 9 = 9
                           // 10 = 10
                           // 11 = 11
                           // 12 = 12
                           // 13 = 13
                           // 14 = 14
                           // 15 = 15
                           // 16 = 16
                           // 17 = 17
